          "id": 3824949712,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "You say:\n\n> In GLib, g_malloc(0) returns a non-NULL pointer\n\nAccording to the [GLib documentation](https://docs.gtk.org/glib/func.malloc.html):\n\n> If n_bytes is 0 it returns NULL.",
